# Low Water, vertical slice: Lamp Quay, 23:00 to 00:00.
# Format: LWD/0, a draft for the BuildLang track (see LWD-FORMAT.md). Private draft, 2026-10-16.
# Narration (nar) is the assessor's report, in the house voice. Speakers are in capitals.

@meta
title: Low Water: Lamp Quay, 23:00 to 00:00
format: lwd/0
start: arrive
clock: 23:00
end-clock: 00:00
at-end: midnight

